---------------------------

Files under assets/ are derived from gentle-ai, which is distributed under the
MIT License:

  Project:  Gentleman-Programming/gentle-ai
  URL:      https://github.com/Gentleman-Programming/gentle-ai
  Commit:   09e4e4aef14e87199784fcf4edb667017d70b9b3
